## Description

Introducing hybrid compute in Perplexity Computer.  Computer can start a task in the cloud, then move to a local model that runs on your Mac. Use it for steps involving private files or sensitive data.  Available today in the Perplexity Mac app. https://t.co/bafirGWgwA

